- **`connect_pins`**  
  Connects the pin of one symbol to another.  
  Example: `connect_pins("U1", "VCC/DAT", "#PWR1", "+1V8")`.

- **`write_out_all_wires`**  
  Finalises the schematic by writing all wire data.

